==Ossetian==

===Etymology===
From earlier {{m|os||*дан}} (attested in placenames, and compare {{cog|ysc|dan}}) with ''a'' → ''o'' before a nasal, from {{inh|os|xsc-pro|*dānu}}, from {{inh|os|ira-pro|*dáHnu|*dānu}} (compare {{cog|ae|𐬛𐬁𐬥𐬎|t=river}}), from {{inh|os|iir-pro|*dáHnu}} (compare {{cog|sa|दानु|t=drop, dew}}), from {{inh|os|ine-pro|*déh₂nu}}.

===Noun===
{{head|os|noun|Iron plural|дæттæ|Digor plural|дæнттæ}}

# [[water]]
# [[river]]
# [[juice]]

===References===
* {{R:os:Iron}}
* {{R:os:Digor}}
